      "Misc": {
        "Unresolved": [
          "[sign] Unit 2 sign truss: truss CL parallel to the pier at STA 7595\u002B82.22 (pier \u002B 5\u0027-10); sheets 171A/172A give the post lines 2\u0027-2 and 9\u0027-6 ahead of the CL pier (plan sheet 110 \u00222\u0027-2 (TYP.)\u0022); the sheet title-block station 7595\u002B67.24 is the bridge reference, not a sign location.",
          "[sign] Exit sign bases: station not printed (sheets 104 / 108 show only a tick on the north girder; scaled about 50\u0027-0 back of CL bearing Pier 5WB and about 60\u0027 back of Pier 11WB): not placed.",
          "[cushion] End posts: start of the end block from the CL pier (scaled about 2\u0027-1 on Ramp A), wedge direction, plan width at the pier end (two 1\u0027-5 rails \u002B gap) and the skewed Ramp G plan are not dimensioned; the I.M. 455 crash cushion has no geometry in the plans."
        ],
